WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 10=

01:47.940 --> 01:51.660
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

01:55.330 --> 01:57.340
What exactly are you trying to do?

01:58.370 --> 02:01.670
Fang Muyang refused
to stay home last night.

02:01.670 --> 02:02.720
He insisted on coming here.

02:02.850 --> 02:04.420
I tried to stop him, but I couldn't.

02:04.420 --> 02:05.940
You know

02:06.200 --> 02:07.580
he's still

02:08.010 --> 02:10.130
not fully recovered.

02:10.620 --> 02:13.040
If he does something out of line,
that won't be good.

02:13.440 --> 02:14.810
So I had to follow him here.

02:14.930 --> 02:16.670
You can't sleep here.

02:17.160 --> 02:18.300
This is the factory office,

02:18.460 --> 02:19.460
not your home.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.040
Pack your things.

02:21.460 --> 02:22.480
Go. Get out.

02:22.480 --> 02:23.120
I'm not leaving.

02:24.280 --> 02:25.250
My unit is gone.

02:25.460 --> 02:26.740
Where do you expect me to go?

02:27.510 --> 02:29.300
Do you expect us
to sleep on the street?

02:30.570 --> 02:31.290
Where you sleep

02:31.290 --> 02:32.220
is none of my concern.

02:32.560 --> 02:33.960
You can't sleep in the office!

02:35.670 --> 02:36.180
Feng Lin.

02:36.671 --> 02:37.700
Throw their bedding out.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.060
Notify Security.

02:39.240 --> 02:39.980
Have them removed.

02:41.220 --> 02:41.980
Feng Lin?

02:43.130 --> 02:44.370
So you're Feng Lin.

02:46.182 --> 02:47.650
I heard you were assigned housing.

02:51.410 --> 02:52.900
Ms. Xu once taught me

02:53.800 --> 02:54.810
to put others first.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.550
You're a college graduate

02:57.220 --> 02:58.410
and a key member.

02:59.337 --> 03:00.810
Why don't you show some generosity

03:01.250 --> 03:02.460
and give us your place?

03:07.410 --> 03:08.340
Everyone knows

03:09.430 --> 03:10.440
I had a head injury

03:10.740 --> 03:12.020
saving you.

03:12.293 --> 03:13.810
Some days are better, some worse.

03:14.850 --> 03:15.950
Things from before

03:17.090 --> 03:18.450
come back to me sometimes.

03:19.220 --> 03:21.100
I remember that day...

03:21.640 --> 03:22.530
It was pouring rain.

03:25.210 --> 03:25.940
Then suddenly,

03:27.190 --> 03:28.670
lightning split a tree in half.

03:29.370 --> 03:31.210
And I watched your house collapse.

03:32.340 --> 03:33.190
What is it?

03:34.493 --> 03:35.630
(Without the certificate,)

03:35.630 --> 03:36.720
(we're not legally married.)

03:37.250 --> 03:38.880
(If anyone sees us sleeping together,)

03:38.880 --> 03:40.400
it's a conduct problem.

03:40.610 --> 03:41.980
(We'll both be finished, okay?)

03:45.493 --> 03:46.820
The moment I walked in, I saw...

03:46.820 --> 03:47.360
Ms. Xu.

03:49.300 --> 03:50.340
As a factory officer,

03:50.804 --> 03:52.110
I should endure hardship first

03:52.110 --> 03:53.182
and enjoy comfort later.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.270
I'm willing to give them my unit.

03:55.680 --> 03:56.410
I believe

03:56.590 --> 03:59.370
he needs this place more than I do.

04:00.130 --> 04:00.960
Feng,

04:01.560 --> 04:02.650
this is...

04:06.410 --> 04:07.060
Ms. Xu,

04:07.650 --> 04:09.970
a little hardship on my end is nothing.

04:10.880 --> 04:11.760
But their action...

04:13.540 --> 04:14.970
might reflect badly on you.

04:15.937 --> 04:17.315
I don't want you affected.

04:17.940 --> 04:18.890
Feng,

04:19.280 --> 04:20.250
hearing that

04:21.420 --> 04:22.790
gives me great relief.

04:24.980 --> 04:25.570
Look at this.

04:26.830 --> 04:28.150
This is the difference.

04:29.210 --> 04:31.060
This is what awareness looks like.

04:36.990 --> 04:37.920
Comrade Feng Lin,

04:40.730 --> 04:41.630
thank you.

04:57.540 --> 04:59.060
(When our comrades face difficulties,)

04:59.060 --> 05:00.715
(see the achievements,
see the light,)

05:00.737 --> 05:01.660
(and raise our courage.)

05:02.540 --> 05:03.560
Fine. You can stay.

05:03.770 --> 05:04.940
Go ahead, stay!

05:05.180 --> 05:06.180
So be it!

05:07.250 --> 05:08.420
Let's see how you manage!

05:12.540 --> 05:13.800
Let's see how you manage!

05:13.980 --> 05:16.210
Feng Lin, what are you doing?

05:19.080 --> 05:20.540
I may have given you the unit,

05:21.130 --> 05:23.010
but I painted these walls myself.

05:23.010 --> 05:24.271
I'll paint them however I want!

05:25.250 --> 05:26.350
This is our place.

05:26.350 --> 05:27.430
Feng Lin, don't push it.

05:27.430 --> 05:28.250
I don't care!

05:30.330 --> 05:32.330
I just won't let you have it easy.

05:32.950 --> 05:33.810
Feng Lin.

05:34.980 --> 05:35.680
Feng Lin!

05:40.450 --> 05:41.130
Feng Lin.

05:42.320 --> 05:43.630
I'll say this one last time.

05:44.980 --> 05:46.980
I'm only taking back what's mine.

05:47.820 --> 05:48.680
As long as you stop

05:48.782 --> 05:49.980
giving Fei Ni a hard time,

05:51.426 --> 05:53.130
the things I'm not supposed to remember

05:56.060 --> 05:57.420
will be forgotten completely.

06:00.450 --> 06:01.660
Why should I believe you?

06:02.610 --> 06:03.810
You don't have a choice.

06:12.210 --> 06:13.010
Let her go.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.010
I've got an idea.

06:29.020 --> 06:30.010
Let's buy something.

06:32.940 --> 06:34.650
I've been meaning to ask.

06:35.430 --> 06:37.200
Why is Feng Lin so afraid of you?

06:38.770 --> 06:39.660
Don't ask.

06:40.210 --> 06:41.520
We got the unit back anyway.

06:53.270 --> 06:53.980
Don't be nervous.

06:54.180 --> 06:55.250
My parents are easygoing.

06:57.740 --> 06:58.420
Dad.

06:58.500 --> 06:59.120
Mom.

06:59.870 --> 07:00.570
You're back.

07:01.080 --> 07:02.010
Good, good.

07:02.870 --> 07:03.920
This is Fang Mujing.

07:04.130 --> 07:04.940
Dad, Mom.

07:05.870 --> 07:06.810
Don't just stand there.

07:06.810 --> 07:08.110
Take Jing to wash her hands.

07:08.110 --> 07:09.200
Dinner's ready.

07:09.200 --> 07:09.770
Go on.

07:10.010 --> 07:10.640
Yes, go on.

07:14.220 --> 07:17.260
(Qu Xueli, Gu Aizhen)

07:20.940 --> 07:21.600
Fang,

07:22.140 --> 07:24.640
Qu Hua has always
been a level-headed person.

07:25.260 --> 07:26.940
For him to suddenly start seeing you,

07:27.700 --> 07:30.260
and then suddenly say
he wants to marry you,

07:31.940 --> 07:33.020
to be honest,

07:33.280 --> 07:35.790
his father and I
were a little surprised.

07:36.990 --> 07:39.450
But after meeting you today,

07:41.290 --> 07:42.940
I think I understand him now.

07:52.140 --> 07:53.620
Today is a happy day.

07:54.090 --> 07:56.060
Qu Hua, I give you my blessing.

07:56.330 --> 07:57.530
From today on,

07:58.330 --> 07:59.850
you are revolutionary partners.

08:00.090 --> 08:01.820
In your future work

08:01.970 --> 08:03.090
and in life,

08:03.330 --> 08:04.940
you must support and love each other,

08:05.410 --> 08:06.450
and grow old together.

08:07.290 --> 08:09.090
Come, let's raise a glass.

08:09.090 --> 08:09.720
Fang,

08:10.140 --> 08:13.230
on behalf of Qu Hua's father
and myself,

08:13.410 --> 08:15.740
welcome to our family.

08:17.190 --> 08:17.580
Come.

08:19.700 --> 08:21.210
Thank you, Dad. Thank you, Mom.

08:48.100 --> 08:48.930
Dad, Mom,

08:49.290 --> 08:50.290
after we're married,

08:50.460 --> 08:51.620
I'll fulfill my duties

08:51.620 --> 08:52.650
as a wife.

08:58.260 --> 08:59.050
Good.

09:01.100 --> 09:01.740
Qu Hua,

09:02.290 --> 09:03.050
Grandma's awake.

09:06.290 --> 09:07.100
Grandma.

09:08.260 --> 09:10.260
(Jiang Fengying)

09:11.860 --> 09:13.650
Hua, you're back.

09:15.860 --> 09:17.100
You've gotten thinner.

09:18.100 --> 09:19.620
Thinner is good. I look sharp.

09:20.980 --> 09:21.570
Grandma.

09:23.140 --> 09:24.020
I'm married now.

09:26.460 --> 09:27.790
I know, I know.

09:27.980 --> 09:28.930
Marriage is good.

09:28.930 --> 09:30.870
Now, I can have peace of mind.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.220
This is my wife, Fang Mujing.

09:35.890 --> 09:36.930
Hello, Grandma.

09:43.650 --> 09:44.260
Mom,

09:44.930 --> 09:46.260
we don't really do this anymore.

09:47.170 --> 09:48.460
Her mind isn't very clear.

09:48.460 --> 09:49.250
Just let her be.

09:49.620 --> 09:50.860
I've kept this red envelope

09:51.240 --> 09:53.410
ready for you all this time.

09:54.100 --> 09:54.980
Yan,

09:55.340 --> 09:57.930
now that you've finally married Hua,

09:58.290 --> 09:59.740
I am so happy.

09:59.740 --> 10:01.340
Here, take it.

10:01.980 --> 10:02.770
It's for you.

10:08.620 --> 10:11.290
Yan, take it.

10:15.410 --> 10:16.050
Grandma,

10:17.050 --> 10:18.220
my name is Fang Mujing.

10:21.100 --> 10:22.740
Alright. Take it.

10:27.740 --> 10:28.530
Take it.

10:31.260 --> 10:32.100
Grandma,

10:32.340 --> 10:33.140
we'll accept it.

10:33.340 --> 10:34.100
Thank you, Grandma.

10:34.100 --> 10:35.340
Good.

10:35.860 --> 10:36.390
Jiang.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.050
Stand up now.

10:37.380 --> 10:38.650
Wheel Grandma over for dinner.

10:38.650 --> 10:39.230
Okay.

10:50.380 --> 10:50.910
Let's eat.

10:51.000 --> 10:51.530
Slowly.

10:52.100 --> 10:53.500
Jiang, get a pair of chopsticks.

10:53.570 --> 10:54.030
Sure.

11:00.100 --> 11:01.080
Are you splashing it?

11:01.290 --> 11:02.100
Yeah.

11:02.410 --> 11:04.030
But this is our wall now.

11:04.340 --> 11:05.160
Trust me on this.

11:07.100 --> 11:09.910
Let's go. Three, two, one.

11:17.780 --> 11:23.820
♪If the future cannot be touched♪

11:24.580 --> 11:27.820
♪Don't think too far ahead♪

11:27.860 --> 11:31.220
♪Just work hard for today♪

11:31.620 --> 11:34.900
♪Learn from the sun, how warm it is♪

11:35.060 --> 11:38.820
♪Light up the corners that need it♪

11:38.940 --> 11:41.740
♪The ones who smile the most♪

11:41.820 --> 11:44.100
♪Gain the most in return♪

11:45.300 --> 11:48.700
♪I want a life that's real♪

11:48.780 --> 11:52.180
♪Steady, feet on solid ground♪

11:52.420 --> 11:55.820
♪Slowly, our paths begin to cross♪

11:55.940 --> 11:59.140
♪Each day holds
something to look forward to♪

11:59.300 --> 12:02.540
♪I want a life that's real♪

12:03.890 --> 12:05.890
Well? Did you get the hang of it?

12:06.860 --> 12:07.690
Yeah.

12:09.020 --> 12:09.860
Draw one.

12:09.860 --> 12:11.860
♪Making them into memories♪

12:19.260 --> 12:20.290
How does it look?

12:23.000 --> 12:24.070
A bit problematic.

12:25.020 --> 12:25.800
Look over here.

12:57.660 --> 13:02.460
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

13:04.780 --> 13:09.540
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

13:11.580 --> 13:14.340
♪In the little courtyard♪

13:14.380 --> 13:17.740
♪There you are dancing♪

13:18.700 --> 13:23.420
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

13:25.820 --> 13:30.660
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

13:32.820 --> 13:37.580
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

13:39.980 --> 13:42.820
♪The fallen leaves in autumn♪

13:42.900 --> 13:46.300
♪You belong to me♪

13:46.780 --> 13:50.540
♪When the world is covered in snow♪

13:50.620 --> 13:55.460
♪I still think of you♪

14:00.500 --> 14:03.020
(Spring breeze drifts over the hills,)

14:03.930 --> 14:06.340
(delivering warmth to the window.)

14:07.770 --> 14:09.860
(Willow branches dip into the river,)

14:10.340 --> 14:13.340
(scattering green along the banks.)

14:14.460 --> 14:16.340
(Golden fields of rapeseed flowers)

14:16.770 --> 14:18.800
(are stamps pressed down by the sun.)

14:20.260 --> 14:20.920
Lin Mei,

14:21.170 --> 14:22.220
my request was approved.

14:22.650 --> 14:23.530
I'm going home.

14:23.650 --> 14:24.740
I'm going home!

14:24.740 --> 14:25.860
I'm finally going home!

14:27.260 --> 14:29.650
(Dandelions open their tiny umbrellas,)

14:30.170 --> 14:32.980
(carrying news
of spring to distant lands.)

14:33.740 --> 14:35.860
(See the sunlight blanket the earth,)

14:36.570 --> 14:37.980
(grass lush and green,)

14:38.500 --> 14:39.890
(and wildflowers in full bloom.)

14:40.690 --> 14:43.980
(The whole spring blossoms just for me.)

14:46.420 --> 14:49.860
♪Remember, that's me♪

14:51.380 --> 14:53.980
♪Thinking of you♪

14:53.980 --> 14:55.900
(Spring breeze drifts over the hills,
delivering warmth to the window.)

14:55.900 --> 14:57.700
(Willow branches dip into the river,
scattering green along the banks.)

14:57.700 --> 14:59.650
(Golden fields of rapeseed flowers
are stamps pressed down by the sun.)

14:59.650 --> 15:00.600
(Dandelions open their tiny umbrellas,)

15:00.600 --> 15:01.910
(carrying news
of spring to distant lands.)

15:01.910 --> 15:03.600
(See the sunlight blanket the earth,
grass lush and green,)

15:03.600 --> 15:04.300
(and wildflowers in full bloom.)

15:04.300 --> 15:05.700
(The whole spring blossoms just for me.)

15:29.650 --> 15:31.500
Are you getting used
to the things I bought?

15:33.220 --> 15:34.530
I'm not very good at shopping.

15:36.810 --> 15:38.500
The "Yan" Grandma kept calling,

15:39.340 --> 15:41.010
was that your ex-girlfriend?

15:53.470 --> 15:56.140
Grandma has a malignant brain tumor.

15:56.860 --> 15:58.500
It's pressing on her nerves.

15:58.930 --> 16:01.050
That's why she mistook you for her.

16:04.620 --> 16:06.530
Did Grandma mistake me for someone else,

16:07.180 --> 16:08.950
or did you choose me because

16:08.950 --> 16:09.650
I look like her?

16:22.493 --> 16:25.100
I don't want a lie that falls apart
the second I question it.

16:34.860 --> 16:35.650
Yes.

16:36.570 --> 16:37.740
I proposed to you

16:38.340 --> 16:41.050
because you look like Yan.

16:53.100 --> 16:53.890
So,

16:55.340 --> 16:56.890
Professor Wu knew Yan, too?

16:58.650 --> 17:00.460
Professor Wu is Yan's uncle.

17:09.290 --> 17:10.130
No wonder.

17:11.290 --> 17:12.850
He kept hinting

17:13.260 --> 17:14.900
that I should learn about your past.

17:15.810 --> 17:16.740
But he wouldn't

17:16.740 --> 17:18.080
say it outright.

17:19.660 --> 17:20.610
In his eyes,

17:20.940 --> 17:22.850
I'm just a pathetic substitute

17:23.740 --> 17:25.570
who is still smugly thinking

17:25.850 --> 17:27.740
that I'd found love.

17:32.740 --> 17:33.530
Fang Mujing,

17:34.850 --> 17:37.500
did you say yes to my proposal for love?

17:39.530 --> 17:40.460
Or was it

17:40.460 --> 17:42.260
to escape your family background?

17:45.130 --> 17:47.900
You confirmed
our relationship one minute,

17:47.900 --> 17:49.740
and the next,

17:49.740 --> 17:52.740
you rushed to submit your application
to join the project team.

17:53.810 --> 17:55.330
How much of that urgency

17:55.330 --> 17:57.130
was really about love?

18:01.740 --> 18:03.900
If my father weren't
a revolutionary soldier,

18:05.020 --> 18:06.610
would you still have married me?

18:16.900 --> 18:18.810
If I didn't look like Yan,

18:19.850 --> 18:21.130
would you still have married me?

18:30.740 --> 18:32.330
Since we're both getting what we need,

18:33.090 --> 18:34.610
let's not pretend it's love.

18:35.330 --> 18:37.090
You come from a top cadre family.

18:37.330 --> 18:39.740
You have no idea what injustice
and humiliation feel like.

18:40.330 --> 18:41.130
My family background

18:41.850 --> 18:43.090
is like a birthmark on my face.

18:43.090 --> 18:44.610
People always see it.

18:44.810 --> 18:47.130
It's constantly
reminding me and everyone else

18:47.130 --> 18:48.420
that I'm inferior.

18:49.460 --> 18:50.700
No matter how hard I try,

18:50.940 --> 18:53.460
I can't have
what others reach without effort.

18:54.500 --> 18:55.290
You're right.

18:55.810 --> 18:56.940
I was quick to use

18:56.940 --> 18:58.220
the Qu family name.

18:58.530 --> 19:00.290
But I will also do my part,

19:01.130 --> 19:02.940
and be a proper wife.

19:03.940 --> 19:05.740
Do you think the way you're acting now

19:07.130 --> 19:08.740
is what a proper wife looks like?

19:09.610 --> 19:10.460
Of course.

19:13.850 --> 19:16.020
I can play Yan's stand-in just fine.

19:40.130 --> 19:41.090
Between her and me,

19:42.530 --> 19:43.850
who has the better figure?

19:49.090 --> 19:49.740
What?

19:50.370 --> 19:52.020
You can treat me like her substitute,

19:52.940 --> 19:54.530
but you won't let me mention her?

20:32.182 --> 20:33.770
I'll sleep at the hospital tonight.

21:03.860 --> 21:09.660
(Staff Canteen)

21:16.740 --> 21:17.840
Mr. Li.

21:18.130 --> 21:19.220
Two extra pieces of meat.

21:19.770 --> 21:20.340
Alright.

21:25.180 --> 21:26.130
Don't tell anyone.

21:26.290 --> 21:27.090
Okay.

21:37.090 --> 21:37.700
Fei Ni!

21:38.660 --> 21:39.130
Ms. Liu.

21:40.530 --> 21:40.940
Here.

21:42.290 --> 21:43.090
Have some meat.

21:43.660 --> 21:44.530
Thanks, Ms. Liu.

21:44.570 --> 21:45.610
Don't mention it.

21:45.610 --> 21:46.260
Fei Ni,

21:46.370 --> 21:47.220
congratulations.

21:48.980 --> 21:51.050
I was wondering
how you could even turn down

21:51.050 --> 21:52.090
someone like Ye Feng.

21:52.770 --> 21:54.530
You had Fang Muyang as your fallback.

21:56.900 --> 21:59.740
Fang Muyang may not
have Ye Feng's prospects,

21:59.740 --> 22:00.530
but

22:00.530 --> 22:04.530
Ye Feng's temper was spoiled rotten
by that certain someone.

22:05.130 --> 22:06.980
You were right to break up with him.

22:08.570 --> 22:10.680
Ms. Liu,
Fang Muyang isn't my fallback.

22:11.050 --> 22:11.980
Besides,

22:12.370 --> 22:14.330
I don't think Fang Muyang is
worse than Ye Feng.

22:16.330 --> 22:16.980
Right.

22:16.980 --> 22:17.850
I get it.

22:18.090 --> 22:18.980
My mistake.

22:18.980 --> 22:19.940
That's on me.

22:22.460 --> 22:23.530
Come to think of it,

22:24.337 --> 22:26.770
you and Fang Muyang already
got your marriage certificate.

22:27.050 --> 22:29.090
When are you treating us
to wedding candy?

22:31.740 --> 22:32.570
He's not so stingy

22:32.570 --> 22:34.370
that he won't even buy candy, is he?

22:35.370 --> 22:36.050
Or

22:36.448 --> 22:38.130
is it because he doesn't have a job yet

22:38.500 --> 22:39.530
and can't afford it?

22:39.530 --> 22:40.900
No, of course not.

22:40.900 --> 22:41.500
Then why?

22:41.500 --> 22:42.604
I told him not to buy any.

22:44.370 --> 22:46.980
I think it's a waste of money.

22:48.770 --> 22:50.370
That's just being naïve.

22:50.980 --> 22:52.370
Getting married is a big deal.

22:52.370 --> 22:54.900
If you won't even
give out wedding candy,

22:55.530 --> 22:56.660
people are bound

22:57.370 --> 22:59.330
to talk behind your backs.

22:59.660 --> 23:00.770
Let them talk.

23:00.770 --> 23:01.660
I don't care.

23:01.660 --> 23:02.850
I'm not afraid to face them.

23:04.370 --> 23:05.700
Honestly, you...

23:05.840 --> 23:06.940
- You're now...
- Ms. Liu.

23:07.290 --> 23:09.260
Notify all married comrades
in Workshop One

23:09.260 --> 23:11.370
to gather outside
the factory office at one o'clock.

23:11.810 --> 23:12.530
Alright, alright.

23:13.940 --> 23:15.460
Let's go together after lunch.

23:16.130 --> 23:16.700
Me?

23:19.530 --> 23:21.940
You're a married comrade now too.

23:23.810 --> 23:24.370
Right.

23:26.700 --> 23:33.860
(Strive to Be the Best)

23:34.460 --> 23:35.130
Ms. Liu,

23:35.460 --> 23:37.180
what are they handing out?

23:37.180 --> 23:38.570
Work safety supplies?

23:39.700 --> 23:40.940
Safety supplies?

23:41.770 --> 23:43.050
Contraceptives.

23:45.460 --> 23:46.770
I don't need that.

23:48.130 --> 23:48.500
Fei Ni!

23:49.260 --> 23:50.460
What are you doing?

23:50.460 --> 23:52.050
We finally made it to the front.

23:52.700 --> 23:53.530
Fei Ni,

23:54.040 --> 23:54.750
don't tell me

23:54.750 --> 23:56.850
you're already planning to get pregnant.

23:57.530 --> 24:01.700
We can handle contraception ourselves.

24:01.700 --> 24:02.500
No, no.

24:04.770 --> 24:05.900
Comrade Fei Ni,

24:06.260 --> 24:07.900
don't overestimate yourself.

24:08.660 --> 24:10.330
You young people

24:10.460 --> 24:12.420
always think you can count the days,

24:12.420 --> 24:13.960
that you know what you're doing.

24:15.770 --> 24:16.850
Let me tell you,

24:17.420 --> 24:19.660
when things get heated,

24:19.940 --> 24:22.050
all that planning goes out the window.

24:24.850 --> 24:26.420
So I'm telling you,

24:26.420 --> 24:29.770
no amount of guesswork beats science.

24:32.940 --> 24:34.180
Let's go.

24:34.940 --> 24:38.060
(Family Planning Office)

24:38.060 --> 24:41.020
(Jiangcheng Daily)

24:42.020 --> 24:43.530
I've read your article.

24:43.530 --> 24:44.330
It's good.

24:45.850 --> 24:49.020
After you graduate,
come work at the paper.

24:49.020 --> 24:50.260
Thank you, Uncle Fu.

24:50.260 --> 24:51.420
I'll keep working hard.

24:51.660 --> 24:52.460
Uncle Fu,

24:53.130 --> 24:53.940
I...

24:55.460 --> 24:56.220
Class is over?

24:57.260 --> 24:58.940
Ling Yi's here, too.

24:58.940 --> 25:01.420
You two haven't
seen each other in a while, right?

25:03.130 --> 25:03.850
Uncle Fu,

25:04.610 --> 25:06.370
I came to tell you something.

25:07.220 --> 25:08.220
I'm married.

25:08.530 --> 25:09.740
What?

25:10.020 --> 25:11.330
You're married?

25:11.530 --> 25:12.020
Yes.

25:12.460 --> 25:13.260
When was that?

25:13.660 --> 25:14.420
To whom?

25:14.740 --> 25:15.460
Fei Ni.

25:15.740 --> 25:17.020
She's been taking care of me.

25:18.850 --> 25:20.420
That's wonderful news.

25:20.420 --> 25:21.980
Finally, someone can keep you in line.

25:22.530 --> 25:23.330
Don't forget

25:23.330 --> 25:25.980
to bring your wife over sometime.

25:25.980 --> 25:27.740
Let my wife and I meet her properly.

25:27.850 --> 25:28.530
Sure.

25:29.020 --> 25:30.370
Fei Ni loves good food.

25:30.740 --> 25:32.660
Have Ms. Liu cook her something nice.

25:32.770 --> 25:34.050
Look at you.

25:34.050 --> 25:36.770
You're already doting on your wife.

25:37.370 --> 25:41.120
Don't worry.
She will make braised pork ribs.

25:41.120 --> 25:43.020
That's her specialty.

25:43.020 --> 25:43.570
Great.

25:43.980 --> 25:45.530
I'll thank her for Fei Ni in advance.

25:45.770 --> 25:47.370
You just won't stop saying her name.

25:47.740 --> 25:48.770
Now I'm curious.

25:48.850 --> 25:50.260
What kind of magic does she have

25:50.260 --> 25:53.050
to tame a little rascal like you?

25:53.493 --> 25:54.770
You'll see when you meet her.

25:55.460 --> 25:56.260
I should get going.

25:56.260 --> 25:57.626
Fei Ni's waiting for me at home.

25:57.660 --> 25:58.530
See you, Uncle Fu.

25:59.740 --> 26:01.660
Next time, bring your wife.

26:01.660 --> 26:02.460
Definitely.

26:02.770 --> 26:03.500
Goodbye.

26:06.260 --> 26:08.770
He really caught me off guard.

26:11.020 --> 26:11.850
Uncle Fu,

26:13.330 --> 26:13.770
I...

26:14.020 --> 26:14.940
I'll get going, too.

26:18.140 --> 26:20.020
(Jiangcheng Daily)

26:20.020 --> 26:20.850
Fang Muyang.

26:24.850 --> 26:25.660
What is it?

26:28.260 --> 26:29.020
Do you...

26:32.850 --> 26:33.940
Do you hate me?

26:35.810 --> 26:36.980
Why would I hate you?

26:39.850 --> 26:41.570
I didn't visit you at the hospital

26:41.810 --> 26:44.260
because I was out on assignment.

26:44.370 --> 26:46.090
I did plan to go, but...

26:46.090 --> 26:46.970
You need not explain.

26:48.260 --> 26:49.810
You weren't obligated
to look after me.

26:51.093 --> 26:52.260
In fact, I should thank you.

26:52.870 --> 26:53.850
If you had come,

26:54.160 --> 26:55.290
Fei Ni wouldn't have.

26:55.610 --> 26:56.850
We wouldn't have gotten married.

27:03.740 --> 27:05.290
Your memory's fully back?

27:07.850 --> 27:08.980
In my memory,

27:10.260 --> 27:11.810
we were just childhood friends.

27:12.660 --> 27:13.850
You were never my girlfriend.

27:15.130 --> 27:15.770
As for why

27:15.770 --> 27:17.180
I gave you my university spot,

27:18.020 --> 27:19.330
you know it better than I do.

27:22.940 --> 27:23.610
Ling Yi,

27:24.370 --> 27:26.260
whatever you once felt for me,

27:27.660 --> 27:28.770
now that you've

27:29.260 --> 27:30.610
chosen a different path,

27:31.420 --> 27:33.020
you should put your heart

27:33.420 --> 27:34.810
into that choice.

27:36.850 --> 27:38.260
And besides, I married Fei Ni.

27:39.260 --> 27:40.760
Shouldn't that make you happy?

27:45.120 --> 27:46.400
I am happy.

27:46.980 --> 27:48.660
That's one less rival.

27:49.420 --> 27:51.020
After all,

27:51.370 --> 27:52.740
Ye Feng is what matters most to me.

28:05.370 --> 28:06.515
Where are you taking me?

28:06.900 --> 28:07.900
Come on, get up.

28:08.530 --> 28:09.130
Careful.

28:23.260 --> 28:26.020
You can actually
come up to this rooftop?

28:28.260 --> 28:29.460
I just found out, too.

28:36.020 --> 28:37.050
Here, climb up.

28:46.850 --> 28:48.610
It's beautiful.

29:09.460 --> 29:10.080
Sit down.

29:21.330 --> 29:23.050
I really love this home.

29:23.830 --> 29:25.330
I really do.

29:28.050 --> 29:28.850
Fang Muyang,

29:29.980 --> 29:31.420
we finally have a home.

29:31.940 --> 29:34.530
But it's completely empty right now.

29:34.660 --> 29:36.660
We need to fill it with furniture.

29:37.810 --> 29:39.370
The unit is yours.

29:40.050 --> 29:42.810
I'll cover a bit more
of the furniture costs.

29:43.740 --> 29:44.770
I did the math.

29:45.330 --> 29:47.500
Buying secondhand

29:47.610 --> 29:48.420
is the best deal.

29:49.570 --> 29:50.570
I'm fine with anything.

29:51.260 --> 29:52.610
But I can't let you use secondhand.

29:53.420 --> 29:54.660
Why not?

29:55.293 --> 29:56.370
As long as it's cheap.

29:57.180 --> 29:58.660
Don't worry about the furniture.

29:58.740 --> 29:59.530
Leave it to me.

30:01.360 --> 30:02.610
The money your sister gave you

30:02.610 --> 30:04.050
is almost gone.

30:04.180 --> 30:06.220
You still need to buy brushes and paper.

30:06.660 --> 30:07.940
You should save where you can.

30:08.850 --> 30:10.610
Who knows when you'll start earning?

30:11.700 --> 30:12.260
Oh, right.

30:16.940 --> 30:18.260
I bought you a new pen.

30:20.130 --> 30:20.900
What's this?

30:22.580 --> 30:23.980
(Condoms)

30:24.420 --> 30:24.900
This...

30:26.020 --> 30:28.260
It's nothing. Give it to me.

30:30.000 --> 30:31.300
Give it back.

30:32.330 --> 30:33.180
Fang Muyang!

30:33.180 --> 30:34.337
- You don't know?
- Stop it.

30:34.782 --> 30:35.420
You don't know?

30:35.420 --> 30:37.180
I'll go ask our parents later.

30:37.330 --> 30:38.530
Give it to me.

30:39.460 --> 30:39.910
You...

30:45.400 --> 30:46.740
Are you done? Give it back.

30:46.740 --> 30:47.150
It was

30:47.740 --> 30:48.900
handed out at the factory.

31:10.260 --> 31:12.260
It's already dinner time. Where's Fang?

31:12.740 --> 31:13.530
I'm here, Dad.

31:13.950 --> 31:15.180
Let's add another dish.

31:17.740 --> 31:18.700
You bought all this?

31:18.700 --> 31:19.280
Yeah.

31:19.980 --> 31:21.570
I wanted some pork belly,
but I'm out of

31:21.570 --> 31:22.570
meat coupons this month.

31:23.420 --> 31:24.050
Mom,

31:24.770 --> 31:26.290
I'll buy pork belly next month.

31:26.290 --> 31:27.570
Make us some braised pork then?

31:27.740 --> 31:28.500
Sure.

31:29.770 --> 31:31.240
The month's barely started

31:31.240 --> 31:32.604
and you've used up your coupons?

31:33.660 --> 31:34.700
We're newlyweds.

31:34.700 --> 31:35.770
We should celebrate.

31:36.048 --> 31:36.920
When it comes to food,

31:36.920 --> 31:38.260
you can come up with any excuse.

31:39.570 --> 31:40.570
Alright, alright.

31:41.130 --> 31:42.660
Fang did this for you.

31:42.660 --> 31:44.290
You've been exhausted
fixing up the unit.

31:44.290 --> 31:46.180
He wants you to eat well, right?

31:46.570 --> 31:47.530
Yes, yes, Mom.

31:47.530 --> 31:49.330
Exactly. Your mom's right.

31:50.020 --> 31:51.290
Your wedding

31:51.670 --> 31:53.500
was far too simple.

31:56.850 --> 32:00.180
Even if we couldn't
afford a big banquet,

32:00.180 --> 32:03.700
you should at least hand out
some wedding candy.

32:03.700 --> 32:06.180
Let the neighbors
offer their blessings, right?

32:06.290 --> 32:08.100
Your father's right about that.

32:08.370 --> 32:09.980
Buy some wedding candy tomorrow.

32:09.980 --> 32:10.980
Bring it to the factory.

32:11.050 --> 32:12.180
Alright, I'll go buy it.

32:12.460 --> 32:14.370
Dad, Mom, it's really not necessary.

32:14.370 --> 32:15.740
Money should be spent wisely.

32:16.090 --> 32:17.330
We only get married once.

32:18.460 --> 32:19.570
You're the boss.

32:26.090 --> 32:26.800
This tastes great.

32:26.800 --> 32:27.780
Here, have more.

32:27.780 --> 32:28.660
That's enough.

32:28.660 --> 32:29.448
Stop piling it on.

32:29.471 --> 32:30.180
You two eat more.

32:30.180 --> 32:30.980
I also have some.

32:32.500 --> 32:34.330
Eat up.

32:47.510 --> 32:48.970
Double bed...

32:53.930 --> 32:56.460
Another chest of drawers?

32:57.570 --> 32:58.330
No, no.

32:58.330 --> 32:59.260
Too expensive.

32:59.800 --> 33:00.740
Let's just get a trunk.

33:10.530 --> 33:11.530
Have some water.

33:14.360 --> 33:15.570
Where did you get the money?

33:15.740 --> 33:17.460
I've been saving this for university

33:17.460 --> 33:19.130
since I started working.

33:19.420 --> 33:20.740
I scrimped every month

33:20.770 --> 33:21.740
to save this much.

33:23.020 --> 33:23.610
Right.

33:24.737 --> 33:25.850
And for today's groceries...

33:31.180 --> 33:32.700
I owe you an apology. I'm sorry.

33:32.810 --> 33:34.940
I got a little worked up at dinner.

33:34.980 --> 33:35.850
I shouldn't have.

33:36.290 --> 33:37.530
But, Fang Muyang...

33:42.370 --> 33:44.660
Even if this marriage is fake,

33:44.660 --> 33:46.850
the days we live together

33:46.850 --> 33:48.770
will be real.

33:49.660 --> 33:51.980
Every expense needs to be clear.

33:55.980 --> 33:58.460
At dinner just now,

33:58.460 --> 34:01.460
my parents and I all ate the meat.

34:01.460 --> 34:02.980
So take this money.

34:02.980 --> 34:04.980
Take it. Go on.

34:04.980 --> 34:05.740
Hold on to it.

34:06.330 --> 34:09.170
But if you keep spending
next month's money this month,

34:09.340 --> 34:11.980
and end up starving someday,
I'll have to feed you.

34:12.460 --> 34:13.860
So you're worried I'll starve?

34:14.530 --> 34:16.690
You really only hear half of what I say.

34:16.900 --> 34:19.250
I don't want to
support you if you starve.

34:30.900 --> 34:32.130
This is all the money I have.

34:32.860 --> 34:33.650
What for?

34:34.170 --> 34:35.530
You handle it from now on.

34:35.693 --> 34:36.690
I'm afraid I'll splurge.

34:37.210 --> 34:38.970
Alright. I'll keep it for now.

34:48.650 --> 34:50.210
Another 12 yuan from him...

34:58.170 --> 34:58.860
Students,

34:59.290 --> 35:00.380
outdoor sketching

35:00.380 --> 35:01.550
is the most important course

35:01.980 --> 35:03.900
at our newspaper's
Worker-Peasant-Soldier

35:04.170 --> 35:05.380
Art Training School.

35:06.470 --> 35:07.570
When it comes to painting,

35:08.090 --> 35:10.420
the worst you can do
is shut yourself in.

35:11.360 --> 35:12.620
Nature

35:13.020 --> 35:14.610
is our best teacher.

35:15.730 --> 35:16.480
What are you doing?

35:16.690 --> 35:17.690
Stop! Don't run!

35:18.570 --> 35:20.570
That's stealing from socialist property!

35:21.690 --> 35:22.530
Stop running!

35:25.130 --> 35:27.690
Qiang, are there really fish here?

35:29.170 --> 35:32.130
Yeah. Plenty of fish in there.

35:32.340 --> 35:34.460
But the patrol team
won't let them fish.

35:34.780 --> 35:36.650
So they sneak over.

35:37.500 --> 35:38.900
Focus on your sketching.

35:39.300 --> 35:40.500
No whispering.

35:44.460 --> 35:47.530
(Jiangnan Municipal People's Hospital)

35:47.530 --> 35:48.780
Doctor, how did it go?

35:49.530 --> 35:50.780
The surgery was a success.

35:50.780 --> 35:51.690
(Operating Room)

35:51.690 --> 35:54.170
Dong, brief the family on post-op care.

35:54.170 --> 35:55.690
Alright. Please come this way.

36:28.848 --> 36:29.900
What are you doing here?

36:31.090 --> 36:31.940
Mom said

36:32.340 --> 36:34.340
you're drenched in sweat
after every surgery.

36:35.250 --> 36:37.340
I brought you a change of clothes.

36:37.570 --> 36:38.690
Consider it

36:39.420 --> 36:40.860
a wife's duty.

36:45.940 --> 36:47.130
I never noticed before,

36:47.780 --> 36:49.380
but that color looks great on you.

36:53.648 --> 36:55.050
I didn't dare wear it before.

36:55.271 --> 36:58.071
I was afraid people would say
I still carried bourgeois habits.

36:58.293 --> 37:00.340
With the wrong background,
even beauty is a crime.

37:01.170 --> 37:02.340
But I'm not afraid anymore.

37:05.570 --> 37:06.210
Here.

37:09.182 --> 37:10.020
Let's eat together.

37:10.493 --> 37:12.340
I can't.
I've got school things to handle.

37:24.300 --> 37:27.460
(Jiangcheng Vintage Store)

37:42.530 --> 37:43.340
Fei Ni,

37:44.780 --> 37:46.170
we're newlyweds.

37:46.650 --> 37:48.170
Should we buy secondhand furniture?

37:48.500 --> 37:49.980
If new furniture is too expensive,

37:50.130 --> 37:51.250
we could buy some lumber.

37:51.530 --> 37:52.500
I can build it myself.

37:53.130 --> 37:54.300
What's wrong with secondhand?

37:54.730 --> 37:56.250
It looks perfectly fine to me.

37:59.050 --> 38:00.170
Look at this bed.

38:00.690 --> 38:01.780
I think it's great.

38:02.460 --> 38:03.650
One each.

38:04.660 --> 38:05.280
I...

38:12.170 --> 38:13.170
We're married.

38:13.350 --> 38:15.280
How can we each sleep in a single bed?

38:15.980 --> 38:17.740
The neighbors would
know something's off.

38:18.730 --> 38:20.160
And what about your parents?

38:21.530 --> 38:22.340
Besides,

38:22.340 --> 38:23.690
our place is tiny.

38:23.780 --> 38:25.382
Where would we even fit two single beds?

38:26.870 --> 38:27.620
True.

38:29.080 --> 38:29.870
This one's nice.

38:32.980 --> 38:33.980
This double bed is good.

38:35.170 --> 38:36.340
No way.

38:36.380 --> 38:37.070
If we buy that,

38:37.070 --> 38:38.690
I'll have to sleep
next to you every day.

38:42.040 --> 38:44.100
That's what married people do.

38:46.890 --> 38:47.970
Don't forget

38:48.610 --> 38:50.360
what you said on our wedding day.

38:50.650 --> 38:52.470
One big bed divided into two.

38:52.660 --> 38:54.150
We have to sleep separately.

38:56.500 --> 38:57.380
Then I can't help it.

38:58.000 --> 38:59.940
There's no space
for two single beds anyway.

39:11.250 --> 39:12.340
This one's good.

39:12.730 --> 39:14.020
A bunk bed.

39:14.460 --> 39:16.130
One bunk each.

39:16.380 --> 39:18.460
If anyone asks,

39:19.130 --> 39:20.690
we'll say the top is for storage.

39:22.420 --> 39:23.780
Then, it'll look like a dorm.

39:24.530 --> 39:25.650
So what?

39:25.730 --> 39:26.690
It's our home.

39:26.690 --> 39:27.980
I'll put whatever I want in it.

39:31.170 --> 39:33.090
Why don't we need a desk anymore?

39:33.340 --> 39:34.900
You said on our wedding day

39:34.900 --> 39:36.130
that we had to get one.

39:36.940 --> 39:38.170
It's too expensive.

39:38.380 --> 39:39.570
This trunk is better.

39:39.900 --> 39:40.900
It can be a table,

39:40.900 --> 39:41.980
and store things, too.

39:41.980 --> 39:43.090
That's practical.

39:43.090 --> 39:43.980
It's ugly.

39:43.980 --> 39:45.250
It's not even proper furniture.

39:45.250 --> 39:46.340
Who cares if it's ugly?

39:46.340 --> 39:47.650
- Look...
- As long as it works.

39:50.448 --> 39:51.404
I've got an idea.

39:52.340 --> 39:55.210
Let's buy both the trunk and the desk.

39:56.340 --> 39:56.810
No way.

39:56.810 --> 39:57.730
Hear me out.

39:57.730 --> 39:59.980
The trunk can store things

40:00.170 --> 40:01.300
and be a dining table.

40:01.500 --> 40:03.980
The desk can hold books for studying

40:04.050 --> 40:05.250
and double as a nightstand.

40:05.300 --> 40:07.130
Two pieces, four uses.

40:07.530 --> 40:08.860
That's real practicality.

40:11.900 --> 40:12.420
Alright.

40:12.980 --> 40:13.820
Move it in!

40:14.204 --> 40:15.210
Careful, you'll hit it!

40:18.871 --> 40:20.130
Didn't I say don't touch it?

40:20.130 --> 40:20.690
I've got it.

40:20.690 --> 40:21.380
It's fine.

40:22.460 --> 40:23.080
Dad, Mom.

40:23.080 --> 40:25.182
- I'll go fetch some water.
- Dad, take it slow.

40:26.730 --> 40:29.050
You hardly have anything in this place.

40:29.460 --> 40:32.340
I told you to bring
that cabinet from our house,

40:32.500 --> 40:33.460
but you refused.

40:33.860 --> 40:34.340
Mom,

40:34.340 --> 40:36.570
it's just the two of us.
We don't need much.

40:36.780 --> 40:38.210
Besides, didn't I already bring

40:38.210 --> 40:39.300
the sewing machine?

40:39.690 --> 40:40.170
It's enough.

40:40.380 --> 40:42.050
You just hate spending money.

40:42.050 --> 40:43.300
You think I don't know you?

40:43.900 --> 40:45.530
Don't scrimp on the money

40:45.530 --> 40:46.530
we gave you.

40:46.780 --> 40:47.780
I know.

40:47.780 --> 40:49.650
We'll get everything sorted soon.

40:49.650 --> 40:50.730
Don't worry.

40:51.300 --> 40:51.900
Ni,

40:52.380 --> 40:53.780
putting everything else aside,

40:53.980 --> 40:55.250
this bunk bed of yours

40:55.250 --> 40:57.210
looks just like a dorm.

40:58.380 --> 41:00.780
Dad, it's creative.

41:00.820 --> 41:02.170
A bunk bed,

41:02.170 --> 41:04.250
the top bunk can store things.
Isn't that great?

41:05.460 --> 41:06.530
Fine.

41:08.210 --> 41:09.530
It looks strange to me.

41:09.604 --> 41:10.980
It's not like a couple's room.

41:13.340 --> 41:14.780
We just got married.

41:14.780 --> 41:16.340
Practicality comes first.

41:16.650 --> 41:17.340
By the way,

41:17.650 --> 41:18.380
Dad, Mom,

41:18.380 --> 41:20.170
my brother's coming back tomorrow.

41:20.380 --> 41:21.650
You should start preparing

41:21.650 --> 41:23.690
for his wedding with Lin Mei.

41:23.780 --> 41:25.650
Focus your energy on them.

41:25.690 --> 41:27.050
Don't worry about us.

41:27.380 --> 41:28.250
Right, Dad.

41:28.315 --> 41:29.650
I'll change the water for you.

41:41.860 --> 41:44.780
Honey, stop sighing all the time.

41:45.900 --> 41:46.650
It's fine.

41:46.650 --> 41:49.530
As long as the two of them
live well together,

41:49.530 --> 41:50.690
that's what matters most.

41:50.980 --> 41:52.300
No need to worry over nothing.

41:52.300 --> 41:53.380
Dad, Mom, have some water.

41:55.090 --> 41:55.980
No, no.

41:55.980 --> 41:56.980
Just leave it there.

41:57.460 --> 41:58.730
Come here.

41:58.730 --> 42:00.130
Help me stick this up.

42:00.130 --> 42:00.780
Okay.

42:00.940 --> 42:03.730
(Double-Happiness)
There, that side's done.

42:04.170 --> 42:05.380
A little higher on that side.

42:05.570 --> 42:06.730
Higher?

42:06.730 --> 42:07.650
Yes, just a bit.

42:22.500 --> 42:23.280
Comrade Fei Ni,

42:23.900 --> 42:25.260
top bunk or bottom bunk?

42:26.730 --> 42:28.050
I picked the bed.

42:28.170 --> 42:28.730
You choose.

42:28.730 --> 42:29.760
I'm fine either way.

42:31.650 --> 42:32.980
You should take the top.

42:33.050 --> 42:34.090
It's cleaner, for one.

42:34.530 --> 42:35.900
And I can't hold my liquor.

42:35.900 --> 42:37.860
If I ever get drunk with your dad,

42:38.115 --> 42:39.648
I might crawl into the wrong bed.

42:39.780 --> 42:40.570
I'll take the top.

42:42.130 --> 42:42.940
Deal.

42:44.780 --> 42:45.570
Coming!

42:49.650 --> 42:50.380
Chief Wang.

42:50.380 --> 42:52.460
Fei Ni, who would've thought
we'd be neighbors?

42:52.460 --> 42:52.860
Right.

42:53.380 --> 42:54.300
Hello, Fang.

42:54.300 --> 42:55.760
- Have an apple.
- Hello, Chief Wang.

42:55.782 --> 42:56.737
Thank you, Chief Wang.

42:56.737 --> 42:57.337
Hello.

42:58.210 --> 42:59.940
Such a big painting.

43:00.980 --> 43:02.530
Nice, very nice.

43:03.250 --> 43:04.570
Young people are full of

43:04.570 --> 43:05.340
different ideas.

43:10.210 --> 43:11.860
You two are not sleeping together?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
